@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userA = user-a
@userB = user-b

### 01 智能客服 ReactAgent：闲鱼商品咨询
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{userA}}",
  "channel": "XIANYU",
  "message": "这个 p-1001 商品还在吗？能简单介绍一下吗？",
  "history": []
}

### 02 智能客服 ReactAgent：议价底价工具
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{userA}}",
  "channel": "XIANYU",
  "message": "p-1001 买家让我便宜 50，请先查底价策略，再给一段闲鱼回复。",
  "history": []
}

### 03 智能客服 ReactAgent：退款资格工具
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{userA}}",
  "channel": "WEB",
  "message": "订单 o-202605150001 是否符合退款条件？请查退款资格后再回复。",
  "history": []
}

### 04 客服 StateGraph：物流查询
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/graph/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{userA}}",
  "channel": "WECHAT_OFFICIAL_ACCOUNT",
  "message": "我的订单 o-202605150001 怎么还没到？帮我查一下物流。",
  "history": []
}

### 05 客服 SequentialAgent：售后状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/multi-agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "userId": "{{userB}}",
  "channel": "WECHAT_OFFICIAL_ACCOUNT",
  "message": "订单 o-202605150001 的售后到哪一步了？请查状态并给我一段微信客服回复。",
  "history": []
}

### 06 客服 Memory：查看当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/memory?userId={{userA}}

### 07 客服 Memory：清空当前用户
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/memory?userId={{userA}}

### 08 客服 MCP：查看真实 MCP 或 Mock fallback 状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/mcp/status

### 09 客服 RAG：查看主题
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/topics

### 10 客服 RAG：查看知识文档
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/documents

### 11 客服 RAG：新增自定义知识
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/documents
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "id": "custom-vip-refund",
  "title": "VIP 客户退款安抚规则",
  "topic": "refund",
  "content": "VIP 客户申请退款时，先查询订单和退款资格；符合规则时说明处理时效，不符合规则时给出替代方案并创建跟进工单。",
  "keywords": ["VIP", "退款", "安抚", "工单", "售后"]
}

### 12 客服 RAG：召回率评估
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/evaluate?query=VIP客户申请退款需要怎么安抚&expectedTopics=refund&limit=6

### 13 客服 RAG：删除自定义知识
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/customer-service/rag/documents?id=custom-vip-refund

### 14 执行报告：查看最近 5 轮
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/report/runs?limit=5

### 15 规则评估：查看最近 5 轮
GET {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/evaluation/runs?limit=5

### 16 AI 评审：评审最近一轮
POST {{baseUrl}}/minimax/chat-client/judge/latest
